{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-89","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：截差无理线段","englishTitle":"To find the fifth apotome.","book":10,"number":89,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.89","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.89/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":89,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-89@raw-f8feb370c8771a3a","contentId":"euclid-10-89","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f8feb370c8771a3a8d865515d95a0ac5aeb2a36bc7c9e5fe15d46bfc8b587b98","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-89.statement","euclid-10-89.construction.1","euclid-10-89.construction.2","euclid-10-89.proof.1","euclid-10-89.proof.2","euclid-10-89.proof.3","euclid-10-89.proof.4","euclid-10-89.construction.3","euclid-10-89.proof.5","euclid-10-89.proof.6","euclid-10-89.proof.7","euclid-10-89.proof.8","euclid-10-89.conclusion","euclid-10-89.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-89.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-89","revisionId":"euclid-10-89@raw-f8feb370c8771a3a","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"870a303d4bbca6fb0d450c467056cbae0afad9e80d214a17fd8e7ccd145928b0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find the fifth apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找到第五截差无理线段"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-89.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-89","revisionId":"euclid-10-89@raw-f8feb370c8771a3a","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed794daa41bc446a088b32ad6aeeafaf0b950f1793ccfa5ad2bf53d7fe63a111","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a rational straight line A be set out, and let CG be commensurable in length with A; therefore CG is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"准备有理线段、A让CG是长度可公度和A;因此CG是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-89.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-89","revisionId":"euclid-10-89@raw-f8feb370c8771a3a","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3a43c31b7faf881b58eb07be55d050e71919ca18c31cc2bf3acf11943b737dfc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let two numbers DF, FE be set out such that DE again has not to either of the numbers DF, FE the ratio which a square number has to a square number; and let it be contrived that, as FE is to ED, so is the square on CG to the square on GB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"不妨列出两个数字DF,FE,DE,即DF,FE,即平方数,平方数,平方数,DF;并假设FE,ED,CG,正方形,GB,正方形；上述对应量具有相同的比例关系。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-89.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-89","revisionId":"euclid-10-89@raw-f8feb370c8771a3a","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4b6d825af5d4a7284b696798afd08f5e9939c6045be75423d941acfd977e3621","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the square on GB is also rational; [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)] therefore BG is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,GB的正方形也是有理;BG也是有理。 [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-89.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-89","revisionId":"euclid-10-89@raw-f8feb370c8771a3a","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8175c9adb164ab2ccfbb81d671f020d2df9dfcff73e686e43ca798e95385015c","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now since, as DE is to EF, so is the square on BG to the square on GC, while DE has not to EF the ratio which a square number has to a square number, therefore neither has the square on BG to the square on GC the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore BG is incommensurable in length with GC. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从此以后,DE比EF等于BG比正方形,GC比正方形,DE比EF,平方数比平方数,EF比平方数,BG比正方形,GC比正方形,平方数比平方数,BG比平方数,BG比平方数,GC比不可公度 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-89.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-89","revisionId":"euclid-10-89@raw-f8feb370c8771a3a","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5913d84aaf875dd0d83d05ee2ee10d01ebf3f8332c4ca2ef6600c69d8b0c8f2a","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And both are rational; therefore BG, GC are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore BC is an apotome. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两者均为有理;因此,BG,GC是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;因此,BC是截差无理线段。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-89.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-89","revisionId":"euclid-10-89@raw-f8feb370c8771a3a","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a321b11b3e08b0162890559ededc8cee538ce555a1d527f963c9e2b675a83074","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also a fifth apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是第5个截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-89.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-89","revisionId":"euclid-10-89@raw-f8feb370c8771a3a","order":7,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"12f43399c5c390ec780ed869f686d43238d4f72fc8d0ccba7d782488cfb83f0e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the square on H be that by which the square on BG is greater than the square on GC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"H正方形BG正方形比GC正方形大"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-89.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-89","revisionId":"euclid-10-89@raw-f8feb370c8771a3a","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"03f800c79903e77450b150832391c0e5954e1469477307b5becad9abb3526cfa","citations":["euclid-5-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then, as the square on BG is to the square on GC, so is DE to EF, therefore, convertendo, as ED is to DF, so is the square on BG to the square on H. [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,BG比正方形等于GC比正方形,GC比DE比EF,因此,转换率为ED比DF等于BG比正方形比正方形比H比正方形 [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-89.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-89","revisionId":"euclid-10-89@raw-f8feb370c8771a3a","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f9c89456df58ec0b1a52d9fdccfcbb28ef2df3a2b618a67eb27ed8b1f09d2190","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But ED has not to DF the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore neither has the square on BG to the square on H the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore BG is incommensurable in length with H. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但ED的比例为平方数,而平方数的比例为平方数;因此,H的比例为正方形,而BG的比例为正方形,而H的比例为平方数;因此,BG的比例为不可公度,而H的比例为不可公度。（相关点与线段：DF） [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-89.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-89","revisionId":"euclid-10-89@raw-f8feb370c8771a3a","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1b5b0dc562f0618240348bf1835bacd5375a104349d80b22a06684544eb0c5c4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the square on BG is greater than the square on GC by the square on H; therefore the square on GB is greater than the square on GC by the square on a straight line incommensurable in length with GB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BG线上的正方形比GC线上的正方形比H线上的正方形要高,GB线上的正方形比GC线上的正方形比不可公度上的不可公度长,GB线上正方形上正方形比正方形还要高。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-89.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-89","revisionId":"euclid-10-89@raw-f8feb370c8771a3a","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9251eea4f77409810d021acb5bf72edc3d7966eb87148e29c555250a39735c0b","citations":["euclid-10-def-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the annex CG is commensurable in length with the rational straight line A set out; therefore BC is a fifth apotome. [[X. Deff. III. 5](/principles/euclid-10-def-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"附件CG是长度可公度,有理线段 A已经列出,因此,BC是第五个截差无理线段。 [[X. Deff. III. 5](/principles/euclid-10-def-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-89.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-89","revisionId":"euclid-10-89@raw-f8feb370c8771a3a","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4483715bd1d849af0c50b2fa94a0d1a95a26f41db619c3524db4ad2e75248c6d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the fifth apotome BC has been found. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,发现了第五批截差无理线段,BC Q. E,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-89.source","contentId":"euclid-10-89","revisionId":"euclid-10-89@raw-f8feb370c8771a3a","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cc316d7f10c77f1930fb093e601ea38fc6f8543f229fee65ae684553441b5fcb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.89/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.89\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-89:euclid-10-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-89","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-89.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.89","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.89/","sourceLabel":"X. 6"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-89:euclid-10-9:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-89","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-89.proof.2","euclid-10-89.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-9","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"ur